#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Block 112: exact even-parity paired branch and zero-sum frontier.

The paired momentum sector is not globally odd: an exact lower-graph chart
has negative-count split (1,1) and assembles with positive self sectors to
inertia (14,2,0).  The same chart at the second shear has split (2,2) and
assembles to (12,4,0).  Exact probes attain paired sums 1, 2, 3, and 4,
including a (0,3) definite-half point.  No displayed point has sum 0, so the
paired floor remains open.  This is not a transporter impossibility and does
not derive the actual ADM/history transporter or any gravity closure.
"""

